        "content": "## SUB · Get FAQ\nLesson 4.1. The get_faq tool for the FAQ agent: reads the FAQ sheet and returns every topic and answer as one small list.\n\nThe lesson attaches a Google Sheets tool directly; this template does the same read in a sub-workflow so it imports on any n8n version. Same result for the agent.\n\n**Credential:** Google Sheets OAuth2.\n**Replace:** YOUR_SHEET_ID.",
